{
    "groupId": "7557",
    "total_dialogue_lines": 17,
    "speaker_counts": {
        "Dozorov": 7,
        "Paimon": 7,
        "Player": 3
    },
    "talks": [
        {
            "talkId": "6755701",
            "initDialog": "675570101",
            "dialogues": [
                {
                    "id": "675570101",
                    "speaker": "Dozorov",
                    "text": "Uh, Morepesok may look like a humble fishing village by the sea, but let me tell you, the youngest of the Fatui Harbingers actually hails from right here!"
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "talkId": "6755702",
            "initDialog": "675570201",
            "dialogues": [
                {
                    "id": "675570201",
                    "speaker": "Player",
                    "text": "About the youngest Harbinger..."
                },
                {
                    "id": "675570202",
                    "speaker": "Dozorov",
                    "text": "That would be Master Childe himself! Ah, I basically watched the boy grow up. Even back then, he was always an absolute handful... I mean, a remarkably sharp-witted child!"
                },
                {
                    "id": "675570203",
                    "speaker": "Dozorov",
                    "text": "He wasn't even ten when he started heading out to sea with the older teenagers. He'd even sneakily... \"borrow\" the dried fish hanging in my yard!"
                },
                {
                    "id": "675570204",
                    "speaker": "Dozorov",
                    "text": "I could tell even then that the kid was bound to become a total monster... I mean, a mastermind! A man of great consequence!"
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "talkId": "6755703",
            "initDialog": "675570301",
            "dialogues": [
                {
                    "id": "675570301",
                    "speaker": "Player",
                    "text": "A remarkable land indeed... breeding such \"masterminds.\""
                },
                {
                    "id": "675570302",
                    "speaker": "Dozorov",
                    "text": "Aye, the fishermen living along these shores are all warriors who battle the sea... Don't underestimate the grit we forge amidst the icy waters and giant waves!"
                },
                {
                    "id": "675570303",
                    "speaker": "Dozorov",
                    "text": "*sigh*... If this miserable arthritis of mine weren't acting up so much, I'd still be out there braving the waves with those young lads. A shame... a real shame..."
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "talkId": "6755704",
            "initDialog": "675570401",
            "dialogues": [
                {
                    "id": "675570401",
                    "speaker": "Player",
                    "text": "I'll leave you to it, then."
                },
                {
                    "id": "675570402",
                    "speaker": "Dozorov",
                    "text": "Mm... Alright. Goodbye..."
                }
            ]
        },
